        },
        "note": "Doc 41 cut RS.1 (Q-41-1): the tender, the prospector's chassis without the drill, 7 t dry (provisional), unarmed, one teleoperated cab. Its stores take bulk (munitions, structural alloys and yard fittings): 2.7 t / 4.8 m3, a tonne of alloys and a tonne of fittings beside a magazine (provisional; the plan's 2,000 kg held the two tonnes and nothing else). logistics.tender names the stores and the reach, one cell (1,500 cm, the tow's); logistics.recovery_profile recovery_optimized tows three times its mass (Q-41-27). Occator leases it beside the escort (+tv/lease tender).",
